parameters.help_en:
By default, prefetch requests carry the Accept-Encoding:gzip header. If you need prefetch requests to carry other headers or implement multi-replica prefetching, you can use this parameter to customize the prefetch headers. Submit the value in JSON format.

If you do not need the Accept-Encoding header during prefetching, submit the value as follows:
{"Accept-Encoding": [" "]}

parameters.help_zh:
预热请求默认携带的header是Accept-Encoding:gzip，如果您需要预热请求携带其他header，或者实现多副本预热，那么可以使用该参数来实现自定义预热header。用JSON串格式提交。

若预热的时候不需要Accept-Encoding头部，则按如下提交
{"Accept-Encoding": [" "]}
